json_array_size | brand-new array (size 8, entries 0)\njson_array_append_new | appends 1..8 (no realloc) then the 9th (grow to 16)\njson_array_insert_new | index 0, middle, index == entries (no memmove), index > entries (rejected)\njson_array_set_new | valid index; index >= entries (rejected)\njson_array_remove | index 0, middle, last element (no memmove), out of range (rejected)\njson_array_clear | populated array (entries=0, capacity kept)\njson_array_extend | other larger than 2x capacity  (takes the size+amount side of json_array_grow)\njson_array_extend | empty other; non-array argument (rejected)\njson_array_get | valid index, index == entries, huge index (NULL)\njson_string / json_stringn | \"\", ASCII, 2/3/4-byte UTF-8, embedded NUL via json_stringn\njson_string / json_stringn | invalid UTF-8  (rejected: NULL)\njson_string_nocheck / json_stringn_nocheck | invalid UTF-8 (accepted)\njson_string_set / json_string_setn | new value shorter and longer than the old; embedded NUL; invalid UTF-8 (rejected)\njson_string_set_nocheck / json_string_setn_nocheck | invalid UTF-8 (accepted)\njson_string_value / json_string_length | on a string; on a non-string (NULL / 0)\njson_integer / json_integer_set / json_integer_value | 0, -1, LLONG_MIN, LLONG_MAX; wrong type (0 / -1)\njson_real / json_real_set / json_real_value | 0.0, -0.0, subnormal 5e-324, DBL_MAX\njson_real / json_real_set | NaN and +/-Inf  (rejected: NULL / -1 -- the only values json_t cannot hold)\njson_number_value | integer, real, and a non-number (0.0)\njson_true / json_false / json_null | singletons with refcount (size_t)-1 (incref/decref are no-ops)\njson_equal | same pointer; type mismatch (integer 1 vs real 1.0 -> 0); NULL argument -> 0\njson_equal | equal/unequal objects (size then per-key), arrays (order-sensitive), strings (length+memcmp, NUL-safe), integers, reals\njson_copy | object/array (shallow: children shared), string, integer, real, and a singleton (returns the SAME pointer)\njson_deep_copy | n