\n`dtoa_r` was retranslated from the preprocessed active C (all `#ifdef`s resolved\nwith the real build flags), emulating the original `goto` graph with an explicit\nstate machine. The differential driver went from **232 differing lines to 0**.\nMDEOF\nwc -l SYMBOLS.md","description":"Append verification record to SYMBOLS.md"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2670,"cache_read_input_tokens":322842,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2670,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c1ef89ae-e696-4035-a7a9-923ffb551939","uuid":"b6360d4b-4407-443c-8189-9a12c42a3642","timestamp":"2026-08-14T15:24:45.133Z"}
